# a2f0/tearleads#2864 DWPB-2 (greenfield flag day): the attachment bind
# acknowledges the resolved KEK targets by `blobKeyTargetHash` and
# `blobAccessManifestHash` instead of echoing `blobKekTargets`. Remove this
# exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
POST /blobs/{blobId}/attachment-bindings removed the required property `blobKekTargets` from the response with the `200` status

# a2f0/tearleads#2864 DWP-1 (greenfield flag day): the document sync response
# no longer echoes the current content-key bundle the request named. Remove
# this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
POST /documents/{documentId}/sync removed the required property `contentKeyBundle` from the response with the `200` status

# a2f0/tearleads#2864 DWP-1: the document sync response no longer echoes the
# KEK targets the request named. Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main
# contains the new contract.
POST /documents/{documentId}/sync removed the required property `documentKekTargets` from the response with the `200` status
